# UI

Shared widgets live in `lib/shared/view/widgets/` (`ArticleItem`, `SourceItem`). Feature-only widgets stay in `lib/<feature>/view/widgets/`.

Theme is `ThemeData` in `App` (`ColorScheme.fromSeed`, Material 3). Read it with `Theme.of(context)`.

```dart
class ArticleItem extends StatelessWidget {
  const ArticleItem({
    super.key,
    required this.model,
    this.isInFavorites = false,
  });

  final NewsArticleViewModel model;
  final bool isInFavorites;
}
```

- `const` constructors, `final` fields, `super.key`
- Pages are `*_page.dart` and usually a `Scaffold`. Extract the body into `*_content.dart` when the bloc state is loaded.
- Document non-obvious public widgets with `///`
